        <div class="inner-header">
            <h1 class="title">
                「澄澄老師」陳偉澄在朝陽社區推動銀髮運動受到肯定
            </h1>
            <div class="source-time">
                <div class="source-group d-flex">
                    <div class="source d-flex">
                        <a class="source-name fs-2" href="/realtime/playnownews">旅食樂</a>
                    </div>
